#: src/iconlib/cmd/main.py:48
msgid ""
"Commands:\n"
"  search [pattern]   list matching icon names\n"
"  which [-a] name    print icon path(s)\n"
"  info name          print icon metadata\n"
"  libraries          list discovered icon libraries\n"
"  pull [pattern]     copy icons into the project\n"
"  push [pattern]     upload icons (not implemented)\n"
"  browse [pattern]   open themestylebrowser\n"
"  index              generate web preview and/or FAISS index\n"
"  delete name...     remove local icon files\n"
"  rename old new     rename local icon files\n"
"  copy from to       copy local icon files\n"
"  ln [-sf] tgt name  link local icon files\n"
"  make [-s SIZE] [-F FMT] name...  derive local variants\n"
"\n"
"Pattern: empty=all, exact name, glob, or /regex\n"
"Plain English words also match synonyms/inflections (scored).\n"
"Local commands operate under project-dir/local-dir (default: icons/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Befehle:\n"
"  search [pattern]   passende Icon-Namen auflisten\n"
"  which [-a] name    Icon-Pfad(e) ausgeben\n"
"  info name          Icon-Metadaten ausgeben\n"
"  libraries          gefundene Icon-Bibliotheken auflisten\n"
"  pull [pattern]     Icons in das Projekt kopieren\n"
"  push [pattern]     Icons hochladen (nicht implementiert)\n"
"  browse [pattern]   themestylebrowser öffnen\n"
"  index              Webvorschau und/oder FAISS-Index erzeugen\n"
"  delete name...     lokale Icon-Dateien entfernen\n"
"  rename old new     lokale Icon-Dateien umbenennen\n"
"  copy from to       lokale Icon-Dateien kopieren\n"
"  ln [-sf] tgt name  lokale Icon-Dateien verknüpfen\n"
"  make [-s SIZE] [-F FMT] name...  lokale Varianten ableiten\n"
"\n"
"Muster: leer=alle, exakter Name, Glob oder /Regex\n"
"Einfache englische Wörter treffen auch Synonyme/Flexionen (bewertet).\n"
"Lokale Befehle wirken unter project-dir/local-dir (Standard: icons/).\n"

